  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "{I} {have} a special place in my heart for {libraries} .I was always an {enthusiastic reader} , {sometimes} reading up to three books a day as a child.Stories were like {air} to me and while other kids played {ball} or went to parties, I lived out {adventures} through the books I checked out from the library, lost among the pages of stories that took me to far-off ( (遥远的) ) places like the {equator} or ancient {palaces} .The scent of old paper and the quiet {whisper} of turning pages were my favorite.",
      "cn": "图书馆 在 我 心中 有 着特殊的位置。我一直是个 满怀热情的读者 ，小时候 有时 一天能读多达三本书。故事对我来说就像 空气 一样不可或缺，当其他孩子打 球 或参加派对时，我正在从图书馆借来的书中体验着各种 冒险 ，沉浸在书页中那些把我带到遥远地方的故事里，比如 赤道 或古老的 宫殿 。旧纸张散发的气味和翻动书页时轻轻的 沙沙声 都是我的最爱。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "My first job was working at the Ukiah Library when I was 16 years old.It was a {dream} job and I did {everything} from {shelving} books to reading to the children for story time.When the {bell} above the library entrance {rang} , it was the start of another day filled with discovery.",
      "cn": "我的第一份工作是在尤凯亚图书馆上班，当时我16岁。那是我 梦寐以求的 工作，从图书 上架 到给孩子们讲故事，我做了 所有的事 。当图书馆入口处上方的 铃 声 响起 时，充满探索的另一天就开始了。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "As I grew older and became a mother, the library took on an {added} meaning in my life.I had several children and books were {our} main source of {entertainment} .It was a big deal for us to {load} up and go to the {local} library.We'd {pack} a picnic with {hamburgers} , {dumplings} , or {pies} , and stroll {downtown} to our favorite library branch, where my kids {could} pick out books to read or books they wanted me to read to {them} .",
      "cn": "随着年岁的增长，我成了一位母亲，图书馆在我的生活中有了 新的 意义。我有几个孩子，书籍是 我们 主要的 娱乐 来源。对我们来说， 装 好东西去 当地 图书馆是一件大事。我们会 带上 一份有 汉堡包 、 饺子 ，或 馅饼 的野餐，然后漫步到 市中心 那家我们最喜欢的图书馆分馆。在那里，我的孩子们 可以 挑选想读的书，或者想让我读给 他们 听的书。"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "After having the picnic food for lunch, I read stories about {dragons} , {whales} , and adventures.I used different voices, as though I were {acting} out the stories {with} my voice and they loved it! We would draw scenes from stories with {crayons} , making it a special time to {bond} with my children and it {filled} them with the {wonderment} of books.",
      "cn": "午饭吃完野餐的食物后，我会给孩子们读关于 龙 、 鲸鱼 和冒险的故事。我会使用不同的声音，仿佛 用 声音 表演 故事一样，他们很喜欢！我们会用 蜡笔 画出故事中的场景，这是与孩子们建立 联系 的特殊时光，也让他们对书籍 充满 了 惊奇 。"
    },
    {
      "num": "05",
      "en": "Now, I {see} my children taking their children to the library and I love that the excitement of going to the library lives on {from generation} to generation.",
      "cn": "现在，我 看到 我的孩子们带着他们的孩子去图书馆，我很高兴去图书馆的热情能够 代 代相传。"
    },
    {
      "num": "06",
      "en": "As a {novelist} , I've found a new {relationship} with libraries.I encourage readers to go to their local library {when} their {budget} is limited and can't {afford} to {purchase} a book.I see libraries as a {safe} haven ( (避风港) ) for readers and writers, a {bridge} that helps put {together} a reader with a book.My favorite library is a {noble} building with {gray} stone walls and tall {columns} that reach toward the sky.I remember the kind {librarian} , {Mrs.} Brown, who has dedicated {nineteen} years of her life to preserving the treasures within its walls.She organized gatherings at the library's grand {hall} , which attracted even the local {council} workers.Libraries, in their own way, help {fight} book piracy ( (盗版行为) ) and I think all writers should support libraries in a significant way when {they} can.Encourage readers to use the library. {Share} library announcements {on} your {website} and social media. {Frequent} them and talk about them when you can.",
      "cn": "作为一名 小说家 ，我发现自己与图书馆建立了一种新的 关系 。 当 读者 预算 有限、 买不起 书 时 ，我就鼓励他们去当地图书馆。我把图书馆视为读者和作家的 安全 避风港，是将读者与书籍联系在 一起 的 桥梁 。我最喜欢的图书馆是一座 宏伟的 建筑，有着 灰色的 石墙和高耸入云的 柱子 。我至今记得那位和蔼可亲的 图书管理员 布朗 夫人 ，她将自己人生中的 十九 年奉献给了保护馆内的珍贵藏书。她在图书馆的大 厅 组织聚会，甚至吸引了当地 市政 工作人员前来参加。图书馆以自己的方式助力 打击 盗版行为，我认为，所有作家都应该在 他们 力所能及的范围内大力支持图书馆的工作。鼓励读者使用图书馆。在你们的 网站 和社交媒体 上分享 图书馆的公告。尽可能 经常去 图书馆，并谈论它们。 5NoOncib/NjiX02BpMIzP+Fxyt/ox+WDCb+dhfH7KaYaJ4u5RsVmLondVmcHiLum9J1BQErGzJvzqa5GEIz4ZA=="
    }
  ],
